FROM golang:1.26.6@sha256:0d1d3a794be25f809dd2cb3160d8c73276c4056a9f8242a138e908ddeee7b6b6 AS builder
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH

WORKDIR /workspace
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download

COPY api/ api/
COPY cmd/ cmd/
COPY internal/ internal/

RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS:-linux} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH} go build -o /fake ./cmd/fake

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static:nonroot@sha256:f7f8f729987ad0fdf6b05eeeae94b26e6a0f613bdf46feea7fc40f7bd72953e6
WORKDIR /
COPY --from=builder /fake /fake
COPY LICENSE NOTICE THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md /licenses/

LABEL org.opencontainers.image.licenses="Apache-2.0" \
      org.opencontainers.image.title="cluster-api-provider-nico-fake"

USER 65532:65532

ENTRYPOINT ["/fake"]
